{"caption":"The video captures a woman in a dance studio facing a wall of mirrors, her back to the camera so her front appears as a reflection. She wears a black crop top, white shorts, white sneakers and a pink face mask, her hair in a ponytail, while ballet barres, string lights and a smartphone on the floor fill the fixed background. She stands wide with hands clasped at her chest, already swaying her torso and hips side to side.

As the routine continues, the heel of her left foot lifts while her weight shifts, then re-plants, the motion reproduced in the reflection. A moment later her right heel rises and her ponytail swings to the side as her upper body turns. Her feet then draw closer together and her body rotates again, hair swinging. The wide stance returns, hands still clasped at her chest.

Toward the end of the visible segment she leans forward and extends her left leg outward and backward in a controlled kick-like gesture. She retracts it to the planted wide stance, the reflection tracking every shift.","length_note":""}
